        <mxCell id="jNsWs_4YDiEsvXyhAXpn-124" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" value="Er wordt nu op twee dingen tegelijk gewacht: flagKnopTurned en het verstrijken van 5 seconden. Vandaar dat after(5s) in dit geval niet met een eenvoudige vTaskDelay afgehandeld kan worden.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Daarom is deze after(5s) voor een alternatieve, verkorte notatie voor:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;entry /&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;timer5sec.start(5000000)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;en langs de uitgaande pijl het event timer5sec&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;df%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20parent%3D%221%22%20style%3D%22shape%3Dnote%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Bsize%3D14%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3Balign%3Dleft%3BspacingLeft%3D6%3B%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%20%3B%20margin-top%3A%204px%20%3B%20text-align%3A%20left%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3Bconstants%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%20%3B%20text-align%3A%20left%26quot%3B%26gt%3BcounterPeriodMs%20%3D%2010000%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%20%3B%20text-align%3A%20left%26quot%3B%26gt%3BcounterValueNeeded%20%3D%203%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%20%3B%20text-align%3A%20left%26quot%3B%26gt%3BcounterReadyMs%20%3D%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3BcounterPeriodMs%20*%20counterValueNeeded%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%20%3B%20text-align%3A%20left%26quot%3B%26gt%3BnameToType%20%3D%20%26quot%3BMarius.%26quot%3B%26lt%